---
import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy - Prayer Times iCal Generator"
  description="How prayer-calendar.com handles your data"
>
  <main class="main">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p><a href="/">Back to the prayer times generator</a></p>

    <h2>Website analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This section is about visits to the prayer-calendar.com website pages,
      not the calendar feed your calendar app downloads. We use <a
        href="https://github.com/rybbit-io/rybbit">Rybbit</a
      >, open-source analytics that we host ourselves at pulse.h2.limited.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        The analytics use no cookies and store nothing on your device. (The
        form separately remembers your own settings in your browser's local
        storage so you don't have to re-enter them.)
      </li>
      <li>
        To count unique visitors, your IP address and user agent are hashed
        together with a salt specific to this site that changes every day, so
        you cannot be recognised from one day to the next. Your raw IP address
        is not stored.
      </li>
      <li>
        We collect: the page URL and query parameters, the referrer, your
        browser and operating system (with versions), device type, screen size,
        language, and a coarse location (country, region, city) derived from
        your IP address at the time of the request.
      </li>
      <li>
        We also record how the form is used: when a form field changes, the
        field name and the value you chose or typed (including coordinates you
        type in), and when the "Get your location" button is used and succeeds.
      </li>
      <li>
        This data stays on our own server. No third party receives it.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions: <a href="mailto:contact@prayer-calendar.com"
        >contact@prayer-calendar.com</a
      >
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .main {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 20px;
  }
</style>
